  "body": "Saltwood is a refreshing reminder that new homes can still have personality.\r\n\r\nWith pricing now from $899,000, this proves that affordable does not have to mean ordinary.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Red Beach's newest coastal community, designed to feel as good as it looks, and live as good as you deserve.\r\n\r\nLot 1 - Sold $1,155,000\r\nLot 5 - Sold $930,000\r\nLot 6 - Sold $1,150,000\r\nLot 8 - Sold $1,070,000\r\nLot 9 - Sold $1,130,000\r\n\r\nCoastal architecture, landscaped laneways and the beach just down the road-it is clear the experienced design team thoughtfully considered how people actually want to live.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms, serious style and sharp pricing. This will not stay quiet for long.\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n- Freehold Titles \r\n- Low-maintenance modern living\r\n- 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms\r\n- Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n- 100% wool loop carpet\r\n- Engineered oak flooring\r\n- Brushed nickel fixtures\r\n- Engineered stone benchtop\r\n- Thoughtfully selected Resene colour palettes\r\n- Ceiling fans in all bedrooms\r\n- Private sundrenched courtyard\r\n- Single internal-access garage\r\n- Moments to the beach \r\n- Zoned for Red Beach School, Orewa College and Whangaparaoa College\r\n\r\nLifestyle, quality and coastal ease, without compromise.\r\n\r\nContact Olivia 021 144 5400 or Tyler 021 0867 7521 today to arrange a private viewing, and let us help you find the one that feels right for you.\r\n\r\nWelcome home.\r\n\r\n*Photos of Lot 15 and Lot 17 included for your reference.",
